[K:bass] z [!courtesy!=E,G,B,]2 [E,G,B,] |[K:treble]"_espressivo""^poco mosso" d2 d>d |$ (c2 f2) | %18
 z/ (c/d/e/{de} d/c/d/B/ | c4) | e2 e>e | (^d2 ^g2) |$ z/ (^d/ e/ f/{ef} e/d/e/c/ | ^d4) | %24
"_cresc. ed agitato" f2 f>f | (^e2 ^a2 | ^e2 ^a2 |$ ^e^aea) | (^e2 b2-) | b4 | %30
!f! (^a2 !courtesy!=e'2-) | e'4- |!>(! e'4-!>)! | e'4 | z4 | z4 |$ z4 | !fermata!z4 | %38
 z"^Tempo I." [df]2 [df] | z [df]2 [df] |$ z [df]2 [df] | z [df]2 [df] | z [^Ad]2 [Ad] | %43
 z [^Ad]2 [Ad] | z [^Ad]2 [Ad] | z [!courtesy!=E!courtesy!=GB]2 [EGB] | z [DF]2 [DF] | %47
